callMsg6 ) MessageEnd:: Message7SenderEnd ( RebookService returnMsg7 ) MessageEnd:: Message7ReceiveEnd ( Customer returnMsg7 ) MessageEnd:: Message8SenderEnd ( Customer callMsg8 ) MessageEnd:: Message8ReceiveEnd ( RebookService callMsg8 ) MessageEnd:: Message9SenderEnd ( RebookService returnMsg9 ) MessageEnd:: Message9ReceiveEnd ( Customer returnMsg9 ) MessageEnd:: Message10SenderEnd ( Customer callMsg10 ) MessageEnd:: Message10ReceiveEnd ( RebookService callMsg10 ) MessageEnd:: Message11SenderEnd ( RebookService returnMsg11 ) MessageEnd:: Message11ReceiveEnd ( Customer returnMsg11 ) MessageEnd:: Message12SenderEnd ( Customer callMsg12 ) MessageEnd:: Message12ReceiveEnd ( RebookService callMsg12 ) MessageEnd:: Message13SenderEnd ( RebookService returnMsg13 ) MessageEnd:: Message13ReceiveEnd ( Customer returnMsg13 ) @enduml